  - id: kade_Chap_1_Chat_1
    subtitle: Well..., another day. okay....Jounral entry.......I need some adventure,
      tired of the same old thing.... Nothing exciting ever happends, and it's always..., 
      Kade.... fix this, Kade..., go get some parts, Kade.. we need you to go grab
      a tank of plasma. I just dont see my self doing this the rest of my life....
      Wel...l, time to get to work.
